{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/31399","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/31399/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/31399/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/31399/events","html_url":"https://github.com/helm/helm/issues/31399","id":3522451698,"node_id":"I_kwDOApspmc7R9Fjy","number":31399,"title":"Helm v4 SDK no longer offers the ability to specify a logger per action","user":{"login":"benoittgt","id":8417720,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTc3MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8417720?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt","html_url":"https://github.com/benoittgt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benoittgt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":778135666,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3NzgxMzU2NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"e11d21","default":true,"description":"Categorizes issue or PR as related to a bug."}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"banjoh","id":681087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTA4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/681087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh","html_url":"https://github.com/banjoh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"banjoh","id":681087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTA4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/681087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh","html_url":"https://github.com/banjoh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banjoh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-10-16T15:43:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T17:07:38Z","closed_at":"2025-10-29T14:03:05Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What happened?\n\nWhile testing Helm v4 SDK. One regression for us is the [inability to pass a custom logger ](https://pkg.go.dev/helm.sh/helm/v4@v4.0.0-alpha.1/pkg/action#Configuration.Init)to `action.Init` anymore. ([before](https://pkg.go.dev/helm.sh/helm/v3/pkg/action#Configuration.Init)). \nI understand the change, but **it removes the SDK’s ability to easily attach specific log contexts per action**.\nAt work, we enrich logs with request metadata before sending them via webhook or message queue, so each Helm action has properly scoped logs with a deployment id we provide. It works very well.\nI had started [implementing](https://github.com/helm/helm/commit/b642bca8f61dfbe19e98ad75b73b2eaac2511405) something similar when migrating parts of Helm to slog, but it was later removed. Still the regression is [my fault](https://github.com/helm/helm/pull/30708#issuecomment-2793640713).\n**Currently, the only way I see is through `slog.SetDefault(customLogger)`, which is global and can’t handle concurrent requests properly.**\n\nIt will be a regression for Flux too. See https://github.com/fluxcd/helm-controller/blob/de97aa9d843c2e9765de217470ba67195b5ce733/internal/action/config.go#L52\n\n### What did you expect to happen?\n\nBe able to have a custom logger per action.\n\n### How can we reproduce it (as minimally and precisely as possible)?\n\nIt is via [SDK](https://github.com/helm/helm-www/blob/d44a2b4cf281b3863077fe74f0df4900ec061b93/sdkexamples/main.go#L38) but code will look like\n```diff\n\tif err := actionConfig.Init(\n\t\tsettings.RESTClientGetter(),\n\t\tnamespace,\n\t\thelmDriver,\n-\t\tlogger.Printf); err != nil {\n+\t\t); err != nil {\n\t\treturn nil, err\n\t}\n```\n\n### Helm version\n\n<details>\n\n```console\n$ helm version\nv4 beta 1\n```\n</details>\n\n\n### Kubernetes version\n\n<details>\n\n```console\n$ kubectl version\n# paste output here\n```\n\n</details>\n","closed_by":{"login":"scottrigby","id":407675,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzY3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407675?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby","html_url":"https://github.com/scottrigby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/31399/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/31399/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}